WEBVTT

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:30.000
If you're watching this, keep the room bright and try to stay away from the TV as much as possible!

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:34.200
She will...

00:01:26.970 --> 00:01:30.000
I'll become a star

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:44.690
This program is brought to you by these sponsors.

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:04.350
Oh, you're awake, Kirari!

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:06.460
Breakfast is ready!

00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:20.190
I'm going to bake more and more!

00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:22.020
You should eat too, Na-san!

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:33.100
for the first time in a year since their debut.

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:37.710
Since their debut, they've been known as the "Idol Queen" for 3 years in a row.

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:41.770
Their 10th single has also been ranked No.1 for the first time.

00:03:41.770 --> 00:03:45.670
In this tour, they'll be on a stage that will remain in the memory of the people who came to see them.

00:03:45.670 --> 00:03:50.070
Let's dance together! Let's Nyancovix!

00:03:50.070 --> 00:03:53.070
Oh! It's Nya-san's favorite Nyancovix, isn't it?

00:03:53.070 --> 00:03:57.340
Nyan! Nyan! Nyan!

00:03:57.340 --> 00:04:00.000
Nya Nyan! Nya Nyan!

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:01.510
It's really nice to meet you.

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:05.510
That's why we'll start school after 15 minutes.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:34.450
Hey, Kirari!

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:36.050
Why don't we have lunch together?

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:43.160
Wow, today's lunch is so good!

00:04:43.160 --> 00:04:46.260
Um, Kishima-san, if you don't mind, can I have this?

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:49.550
What?

00:04:49.550 --> 00:05:00.000
Kirari, you have a good appetite, but how about being a little more girly?

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:01.790
That's right.

00:05:01.790 --> 00:05:04.980
If you were normal, you'd be a super pretty girl.

00:05:04.980 --> 00:05:09.000
It's not strange for Kirari to be scouted by an idol.

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:11.360
Huh? An idol?

00:05:11.360 --> 00:05:13.970
I wish I could be an idol.

00:05:13.970 --> 00:05:16.450
I can meet celebrities every day.

00:05:16.450 --> 00:05:19.490
I can do a TV performance with Chips.

00:05:19.490 --> 00:05:20.830
Chips?

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:22.570
It looks delicious.

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:25.360
Hey, Kirari, don't you know Chips?

00:05:25.360 --> 00:05:27.350
They're so popular.

00:05:27.350 --> 00:05:30.000
Just like us,

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.400
I'm a middle school boy in the 2nd grade of elementary school.

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:36.780
Shinji Isshou Souname's popular national idol unit!

00:05:36.780 --> 00:05:38.630
Anyway, he's so cool!

00:05:38.630 --> 00:05:39.670
Hey!

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:48.620
I'm not interested at all!

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:51.000
What are you interested in, Kirari?

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:55.140
I want to fall in love normally after all.

00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:58.960
I want to meet a wonderful person and have a wonderful love.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:05.850
I want you to eat me!

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:21.190
That's right, I'm still 14 years old!

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:22.620
This is from this!

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:26.250
I'm talking about Nao-san, right?

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:29.020
That's amazing, both of them!

00:06:29.020 --> 00:06:30.000
No!

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:34.070
I'm sorry.

00:06:34.070 --> 00:06:40.360
I'm really sorry.

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:44.240
Wow, what's with that guy?

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:45.440
He's so lame.

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:47.990
I mean, that pair of glasses must be a joke.

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:51.250
Wh-What?

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:38.230
You're not hurt, are you?

00:07:38.230 --> 00:07:45.780
No, I'm fine.

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:48.500
Me too.

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:51.640
Thank you for saving my best friend.

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:56.470
I was worried about being kidnapped by crows.

00:07:56.470 --> 00:07:58.740
I'm Seiji.

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:03.940
This is my best friend, Kame-san.

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:17.820
If I can save Kame, I'll be Tsukishima Kirari!

00:08:17.820 --> 00:08:19.540
Nice to meet you.

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:22.330
Oh yeah, I have something to thank you for.

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:25.520
This is all I have.

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:29.600
I'm going to work here, so please come if you like.

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:39.410
My heart is pounding.

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:43.350
Well, then.

00:08:43.350 --> 00:08:52.980
Are you okay?

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:54.530
I found it.

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:55.350
What?

00:09:12.890 --> 00:09:16.410
I'm sure it's the staff.

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:18.360
I'm going to the bathroom.

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:21.630
Oh, it's shiny.

00:09:21.630 --> 00:09:29.190
I'm going to the bathroom.

00:10:00.220 --> 00:10:01.250
I'm going in from here.

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:54.460
You idiot!

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:59.340
You look pretty cute from up there.

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:05.920
What are you doing?

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:07.130
What?

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:08.130
What is it?

00:11:08.130 --> 00:11:09.130
What?

00:11:09.130 --> 00:11:12.760
What?

00:11:12.760 --> 00:11:13.760
Ouch!

00:11:13.760 --> 00:11:15.960
You jumped down suddenly.

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:17.860
It's dangerous, isn't it?

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:19.220
Ouch!

00:11:19.220 --> 00:11:22.480
It's faster than using stairs.

00:11:22.480 --> 00:11:23.840
Strange person.

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:25.310
What?

00:11:28.020 --> 00:11:28.930
You are...

00:11:28.930 --> 00:11:30.000
Staff here?

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:33.290
Yeah, I guess so.

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:36.250
Giku!

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:39.830
You know, I'm looking for someone.

00:11:39.830 --> 00:11:42.320
The staff member here.

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:44.820
His name is Seiji-kun!

00:11:44.820 --> 00:11:45.580
Hm?

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:50.960
He asked me to come, so I got a ticket!

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:52.950
Do you know where he is?

00:11:52.950 --> 00:11:57.850
You're looking for Seiji? What are you going to do?

00:11:57.850 --> 00:11:59.700
I knew it!

00:12:01.690 --> 00:12:05.590
I fell in love with you at first sight.

00:12:05.590 --> 00:12:08.070
So I wanted to see you again.

00:12:08.070 --> 00:12:13.240
Please be nice to me.

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:22.370
What are you doing?

00:12:22.370 --> 00:12:24.170
Don't get close to Seiji.

00:12:24.170 --> 00:12:28.460
The world I live in is different from yours.

00:12:28.460 --> 00:12:30.000
What are you talking about?

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:35.700
Different? Why do I have to be told that?

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:43.380
You're an outsider. Go home.

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:02.650
I finally met the ideal man!

00:13:04.180 --> 00:13:15.620
What a great woman.

00:13:18.300 --> 00:13:22.320
If this happens, I'll be in trouble.

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:32.600
If you don't have a ticket, you can't get in?

00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:34.560
Of course!

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:37.560
If you don't have a ticket, you can't enter the venue from anywhere.

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:38.670
Um...

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:41.220
No!

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:43.090
Go home! Go home!

00:14:10.400 --> 00:14:12.860
Alright, Nana-san, here's your second strategy!

00:14:12.860 --> 00:14:13.520
What?

00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:16.510
Let's dig a hole in the ground and send it to Seiji-kun!

00:14:16.510 --> 00:14:17.480
Alright, alright!

00:14:31.240 --> 00:14:33.280
I can't come up with a strategy.

00:14:33.280 --> 00:14:34.360
Wow!

00:14:34.360 --> 00:14:36.850
It's a big deal, Seiji-kun!

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:42.670
Hmm...

00:14:42.670 --> 00:14:55.430
That's terrible!

00:14:55.430 --> 00:14:56.330
Hurry inside!

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:58.000
Yes!

00:14:58.000 --> 00:14:59.250
It's this way!

00:15:00.090 --> 00:15:01.090
I'm here!

00:15:02.090 --> 00:15:11.780
Naa-san.

00:15:11.780 --> 00:15:19.910
You're gonna make me cry.

00:15:19.910 --> 00:15:21.830
Seiji-kun, where are you?

00:15:26.340 --> 00:15:28.200
Where are you?

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:46.060
If you find him, I'll kick you out!

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:49.310
Phew, that was close.

00:15:49.310 --> 00:15:54.340
I shouldn't let the outsiders find me.

00:16:00.280 --> 00:16:02.940
Alright, let's go!

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:05.800
I'll go somewhere and meet Seiji-kun!

00:16:05.800 --> 00:16:26.560
You don't know the story of Urashima Taro, right?

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:30.000
A long time ago, with Urashima Taro...

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:36.820
When Taro was walking along the beach, the children were bullying a turtle.

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:39.700
Taro helped the turtle.

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:43.510
Then the turtle said, "Thank you for helping me.

00:16:43.510 --> 00:16:45.370
I thank you for going to Ryukucho."

00:16:45.370 --> 00:16:47.610
"What?"

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:49.810
"I can see something down there."

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:18.220
Online streaming and TV broadcasts all over the world!

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:20.840
Everyone, let's go into the forest!

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:23.440
You came to see me, didn't you?

00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:26.390
Everyone, look!

00:18:26.390 --> 00:18:29.480
The Angel of Conquering is coming from the sky!

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:38.370
She's so cute!

00:18:38.370 --> 00:18:40.120
She's a new idol, isn't she?

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:42.390
Give her to me!

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:46.480
The devil, Hiroto-sama, will steal the angel!

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:56.360
I'll give you a ticket, so you don't have to be stupid!

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:57.300
That's enough.

00:18:57.300 --> 00:18:59.640
You made a mistake at the entrance, didn't you?

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:01.030
That's too much!

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:05.590
You still don't get it?

00:19:05.590 --> 00:19:09.820
You're the only one who doesn't know the real Seiji and Hiroto.

00:19:09.820 --> 00:19:14.360
Seiji, change.

00:19:14.360 --> 00:19:16.040
Seiji, come out first.

00:19:16.040 --> 00:19:28.400
Well, now you know.

00:19:28.400 --> 00:19:29.780
Seiji and you...

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:31.880
You are different from the world you live in.

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:33.510
Give up.

00:19:33.510 --> 00:19:41.980
It's just...

00:19:41.980 --> 00:19:48.880
For Seiji, you are one of the fans who has a lot of stars.

00:19:48.880 --> 00:19:59.600
I don't want to meet the person I love!

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:04.680
If the world is different, I'll go to the same world as you!

00:20:11.260 --> 00:20:17.620
Kirari...

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:24.710
Kirari, you're late today.

00:22:46.120 --> 00:22:49.490
This program was brought to you by these sponsors.
